<http://data.silknow.org/object/dcd2fb78-108b-36ef-89e6-9f762577373e>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Man’s sword hanger of leather covered and lined with brown woollen broadcloth.  Each hanger has 3 scabbard straps held with gilt metal buckles and the hangers are joined at the top with a gilt metal hook.  The hangers and straps are edged with 3/16-inch (3 mm) wide woven red and yellow silk lace [braid]."@en , "Man's sword hanger, 1600-30, English; brown broadcloth, woven silk lace [braid]"@en ;
